// ── unit identity without names (vic prompt.md 2026-11-16: "Names are not part of the content hash") ──
// prompt: hashing state. fd(u) = the first decl id of unit u; rnk(u) = rank of u in its scc; per unit 8 words each: lh = hash of
// the K.MAnon stream, l2 = hash of the K.MShape stream, ids = id; sh (8 words per scc) = scc hash.
enum Kernel.Nf:
  case Kernel.Nf(n: I64, fd: Array[U32](n), rnk: Array[U32](n), n8: I64, lh: Array[U32](n8), l2: Array[U32](n8), ids: Array[U32](n8), sh: Array[U32](n8))

